@startuml
title ASENT module assurance use cases
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle stickman
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 19
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FC
  BorderColor #34506B
  ArrowColor #536B82
}
actor Developer as Dev
actor Reviewer as Reviewer
actor "Git repository" as Git
actor "Package registry" as Registry
actor "OSV advisory service" as OSV
actor "Ollama test generator" as Ollama
rectangle "ASENT module assurance" {
  package "CAVR — Dependency assurance" {
    usecase "Analyze applicable dependency\nartifacts and exact lock" as CAVR
    usecase "Intercept pip install request\nbefore installation" as Intercept
    usecase "Check policy, artifact digest,\ncontract, and advisories" as CChecks
    usecase "Inspect verdict and\nevidence certificate" as CProof
  }
  package "SATRA-RV — Application assurance" {
    usecase "Run baseline / candidate\napplication validation" as SATRA
    usecase "Check security oracle with\nownership counterfactual" as Oracle
    usecase "Generate and validate\noptional test proposals" as GenTests
  }
  package "SABLE — Terraform / IAM assurance" {
    usecase "Verify baseline obligation,\nresource successor, and access" as SABLE
    usecase "Audit standalone\nSABLE run" as SAudit
  }
}
Dev -- Intercept
Dev -- SABLE
Reviewer -- CProof
Git -- SATRA
Registry -- Intercept
OSV -- CChecks
Ollama -- GenTests
CAVR ..> CChecks : <<include>>
Intercept ..> CChecks : <<include>>
CProof ..> CAVR : <<extend>>
SATRA ..> Oracle : <<include>>
GenTests ..> SATRA : <<extend>>
note right of SABLE
Bounded local Terraform/HCL S3/IAM analysis;
unsupported semantics remain UNKNOWN. No live AWS claim.
end note
@enduml
